    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cămīno</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
			caminus, <i>to make like an oven</i> or
				<i>furnace</i> (very rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perh. only in the foll. pass.),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 6, 8, § 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caminata fossura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 11, 16, § 80</span></i>
			.</div>
